    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah but there is no small step. everything is tied together. the bills, the kids, the constant noise... if i stop for even a second, everything falls apart for everyone else. i'm just a machine for them. i feel like i'm in a cage and the only way to actually feel like i'm in control of anything again is to just... stop. to just not be part of this anymore. it feels like the only way to breathe again is to just get away from it all permanently.",
